    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66347" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέσᾰβον</span></b> , τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέσος, βοῦς</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leathern strap</i>, by which the middle of the yoke
